// Physical models of std objects (historical Stage 6, ADR 0002 §4). Model<X>
// indexes the models on the smooth affine object X: each names a symmetric
// endomorphism field of std::linalg::spectral on X, a reading of X, a
// convention, a prepared and an observed basis vector of the field's module,
// the transition average that it predicts and its regime. The kernel checks
// that the references fit together; the regime is a recorded
// assumption, which no check proves. A model computes nothing and changes no
// std declaration.
//
// The convention hbar_one, which writes energies as angular frequencies, is
// declared by the application with `indexed convention c = hbar_one;`. This
// library declares the family only.
pub indexed family Model(object(std::geometry::smooth::affine::CInfAffine))
    = model constraints(canonical(0));
